-- Classic 1.60 (WoW Forever): readable quest items that open to nothing (Discord: "the hunter's note for the Horde Skyborne won't open").
--
-- The Zephras class quests (The Warrior's Path 92532, The Way of the Hunter 92482, At Home in the Shadows 92483, Embracing the
-- Elements 92484, A Student of Nature 92485) hand the player a note from the trainer (282419-282422, 282418). In the 70532 client
-- ItemSparse those notes are readable items with PageID 10958-10963, but the world page_text table has no rows for those pages.
-- The server answers CMSG_READ_ITEM with "OK" (the item has a PageID) and then answers the client's page query with no pages, so
-- the note opens nothing. The same is true for 43 more readable items of 70532 (A Scribbled Letter 251941 for Northshire hunters,
-- the Archaic Rune 282400, the Hallowed Memorandum 282338, the Consecrated Scroll 282423 and others) and for one spawned note
-- gameobject (Note 660331, page 10759).
--
-- The texts are the Blizzard page_text rows of the AnoCore v10 world database (1.60.1.70532). Only pages that a 70532 item or a
-- text gameobject points at and that are missing here are added; existing pages are not changed. Safe to run again.

DELETE FROM `page_text` WHERE `ID` IN (8721,8816,8828,8871,8887,8888,9036,9122,9136,9194,9217,9236,9254,9257,9258,9523,9552,9585,9586,9955,10175,10178,10482,10483,10572,10589,10635,10642,10759,10842,10843,10940,10944,10950,10951,10952,10953,10958,10959,10960,10961,10962,10963,10965,10987,11027,11028,11029);
